        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion AC, Contemporary South Beach Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlone this Fusion made lever is simple but, when paired with a contemporary style rose, it is transformed into a beautiful and modern design. It is available with 3 different rose choices--all of which exemplify a chicness that is associated with contemporary decor. It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and has an optional 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Fusion AC Solid Brass Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid Brass/Bronze Construction</li>\r\n<li>Cycle Tested to ANSI Standards</li>\r\n<li>”Positive Stop” lever spring mechanism</li>\r\n<li>Reversible Latchbolt in matching/coordinating finish</li>\r\n<li>Easy assembly with alignment block and rose posts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for South Beach Contemporary Door Lever Fusion AC:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 3-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection: 1/2”</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass or Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</li>\r\n<li>Square corner latches and strike plates </li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on one side of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on both sides of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<b>** Item Discontinued. See available <a href=\"/collections/modern-door-levers\">Modern Door Levers</a></b>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "South Beach Lever Contemporary Lever, Fusion AC",
                "description": "Contemporary South Beach Lever Fusion AC - Alone this Fusion made lever is simple but, when paired with a contemporary style rose, it is transformed into a beautiful and modern design. It is available with 3 different rose choices--all of which exemplify a chicness that is associated with contemporary decor. It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and can be adjusted for either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. Available in 3 finishes. ",
